n="00:39.210" end="00:39.660">Where </span><span begin="00:39.660" end="00:39.810">the </span><span begin="00:39.810" end="00:40.290">wind </span><span begin="00:40.290" end="00:40.650">will </span><span begin="00:40.650" end="00:41.280">whisper </span><span begin="00:41.280" end="00:41.820">to </span><span begin="00:41.820" end="00:43.470">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.800" end="00:51.120"><span begin="00:43.800" end="00:44.310">Where </span><span begin="00:44.310" end="00:44.550">the </span><span begin="00:44.550" end="00:45.720">raindrops </span><span begin="00:45.720" end="00:45.870">as </span><span begin="00:45.870" end="00:46.170">they're </span><span begin="00:46.170" end="00:47.190">falling </span><span begin="00:47.190" end="00:47.700">tell </span><span begin="00:47.700" end="00:47.730">a </span><span begin="00:47.730" end="00:51.120">story</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.150" end="00:57.150"><span begin="00:51.150" end="00:51.990">In </span><span begin="00:51.990" end="00:52.560">my </span><span begin="00:52.560" end="00:53.340">field </span><span begin="00:53.340" end="00:53.610">of </span><span begin="00:53.610" end="00:54.330">paper </span><span begin="00:54.330" end="00:57.150">flowers</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.210" end="01:03.240"><span begin="00:57.210" end="00:57.540">And </span><span begin="00:57.540" end="00:58.830">candy </span><span begin="00:58.830" end="00:59.730">clouds </span><span begin="00:59.730" end="00:59.970">of </span><span begin="00:59.970" end="01:03.240">lullaby</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.600" end="01:09.960"><span begin="01:03.600" end="01:03.900">I </span><span begin="01:03.900" end="01:04.860">lie </span><span begin="01:04.860" end="01:06.060">inside </span><span begin="01:06.060" end="01:06.840">myself </span><span begin="01:06.840" end="01:07.260">for </span><span begin="01:07.260" end="01:09.960">hours</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.020" end="01:16.650"><span begin="01:10.020" end="01:10.380">And </span><span begin="01:10.380" end="01:10.830">watch </span><span begin="01:10.830" end="01:11.130">my </span><span begin="01:11.130" end="01:11.640">purple </span><span begin="01:11.640" end="01:12.360">sky </span><span begin="01:12.360" end="01:12.900">fly </span><span begin="01:12.900" end="01:13.380">over </span><span begin="01:13.380" end="01:16.650">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.850" end="01:22.140"><span begin="01:17.850" end="01:18.270">Don't </span><span begin="01:18.270" end="01:18.900">say </span><span begin="01:18.900" end="01:19.260">I'm </span><span begin="01:19.260" end="01:19.560">out </span><span begin="01:19.560" end="01:19.740">of </span><span begin="01:19.740" end="01:22.140">touch</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.170" end="01:28.350"><span begin="01:22.170" end="01:22.620">With </span><span begin="01:22.620" end="01:22.980">this </span><span begin="01:22.980" end="01:23.910">rampant </span><span begin="01:23.910" end="01:24.570">chaos </span><span begin="01:24.570" end="01:24.600">- </span><span begin="01:24.600" end="01:25.200">your </span><span begin="01:25.200" end="01:28.350">reality</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.590" end="01:34.620"><span begin="01:28.590" end="01:28.980">I </span><span begin="01:28.980" end="01:29.370">know </span><span begin="01:29.370" end="01:30.000">well </span><span begin="01:30.000" end="01:30.270">what </span><span begin="01:30.270" end="01:30.840">lies </span><span begin="01:30.840" end="01:31.530">beyond </span><span begin="01:31.530" end="01:31.890">my </span><span begin="01:31.890" end="01:32.550">sleeping </span><span begin="01:32.550" end="01:34.620">refuge</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.190" end="01:42.300"><span begin="01:35.190" end="01:35.340">The </span><span begin="01:35.340" end="01:36.510">nightmare </span><span begin="01:36.510" end="01:36.720">I </span><span begin="01:36.720" end="01:37.050">built </span><span begin="01:37.050" end="01:37.470">my </span><span begin="01:37.470" end="01:37.980">own </span><span begin="01:37.980" end="01:38.400">world </span><span begin="01:38.400" end="01:38.850">to </span><span begin="01:38.850" end="01:42.300">escape</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.330" end="01:48.330"><span begin="01:42.330" end="01:43.140">In </span><span begin="01:43.140" end="01:43.710">my </span><span begin="01:43.710" end="01:44.490">field </span><span begin="01:44.490" end="01:44.730">of </span><span begin="01:44.730" end="01:45.480">paper </span><span begin="01:45.480" end="01:48.330">flowers</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.390" end="01:54.360"><span begin="01:48.390" end="01:48.690">And </span><span begin="01:48.690" end="01:49.980">candy </span><span begin="01:49.980" end="01:50.910">clouds </span><span begin="01:50.910" end="01:51.120">of </span><span begin="01:51.120" end="01:54.360">lullaby</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.750" end="02:01.110"><span begin="01:54.750" end="01:54.960">I </span><span begin="01:54.960" end="01:56.040">lie </span><span begin="01:56.040" end="01:57.210">inside </span><span begin="01:57.210" end="01:57.960">myself </span><span begin="01:57.960" end="01:58.380">for </span><span begin="01:58.380" end="02:01.110">hours</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.170" end="02:07.830"><span begin="02:01.170" end="02:01.530">And </span><span begin="02:01.530" end="02:01.980">watch </span><span begin="02:01.980" end="02:02.280">my </span><span begin="02:02.280" end="02:02.790">purple </span><span begin="02:02.790" end="02:03.510">sky </span><span begin="02:03.510" end="02:04.020">fly </span><span begin="02:04.020" end="02:04.530">over </span><span begin="02:04.530" end="02:07.830">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.670" end="02:26.970"><span begin="02:23.670" end="02:24.840">Swallowed </span><span begin="02:24.840" end="02:25.200">up </span><span begin="02:25.200" end="02:25.380">in </span><span begin="02:25.380" end="02:2